#text(fill: rgb("#0f172a"))[Project Proposal: Temple Festival Interactive Simulation]

= #text(fill: rgb("#0f172a"))[Project Overview]

The objective of this initiative is to engineer a compelling *interactive festival simulation platform* that seamlessly integrates cultural heritage preservation with _engaging economic management mechanics_. By employing advanced 3D spatial positioning and AI-driven crowd pathfinding, the project delivers an immersive edutainment environment tailored to modern audiences while showcasing traditional event dynamics in an _unprecedented digital format_.

= #text(fill: rgb("#0f172a"))[Execution Roadmap & Development Phases]

+ Phase 1: Foundation & Core Systems1.1 Spatial plot division, zoning implementation, and grid placement engine1.2 Core user interface design, real-time currency tracking, and local state persistence

+ Phase 2: Assets, NPC Systems & Economy2.1 3D asset pipeline integration including food stalls, attractions, and decorative elements2.2 Autonomous NPC pathfinding AI and real-time cash flow simulation

+ Phase 3: Progression & Dynamic Events3.1 Temple landmark upgrade hierarchy and achievement milestones3.2 Dynamic environment scripting for weather impacts and seasonal festivals

+ Phase 4: Optimization, Testing & Final Delivery4.1 Comprehensive economic balancing, optimization, and bug resolution4.2 Production of showcase media and final prototype delivery package

